## [A2d] get(1s) 타임아웃 뒤 cancel(true) — 반환 타입별로 작업이 멈추는가 (본문 3초)
-- CompletableFuture 반환
반환된 future 클래스 = java.util.concurrent.CompletableFuture
get(1s) caught=java.util.concurrent.TimeoutException
cancel(true) 반환=true isCancelled=true isDone=true
4초 뒤 작업 카운터: started=1 finished=1 interrupted=0
-- Future 반환
반환된 future 클래스 = java.util.concurrent.FutureTask
get(1s) caught=java.util.concurrent.TimeoutException
cancel(true) 반환=true isCancelled=true isDone=true
4초 뒤 작업 카운터: started=1 finished=0 interrupted=1
-- CompletableFuture.orTimeout(1s)
join() caught=java.util.concurrent.CompletionException cause=java.util.concurrent.TimeoutException
isCompletedExceptionally=true
4초 뒤 작업 카운터: started=1 finished=1 interrupted=0
